  "title": "Double-critical graph conjecture",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "A connected simple graph $G$ is called double-critical, if removing any pair of adjacent vertexes lowers the chromatic number by two.\n\nConjecture $K_n$ is the only $n$-chromatic double-critical graph",
